{
  "_readme": "GAME CONTENT, DRAFT PENDING PRODUCER REVIEW (every DisplayName, Title and Text; no art yet: ArtKey is a placeholder key). The Grove (docs/design/grove.md): habitats and decor unlock from a shrine's GroveUnlockId (discovery.json), starting from the account's first save, from an affinity tier, or from a Wildgarden recipe (garden-library.json); a habitat's SlotCount bounds how much decor it can hold. Affinity: Feed/Play grant flat Xp with a daily cooldown each (no stacking, no decay); AffinityTiers is a flat (SpeciesId, Tier) table, one row per species per tier 1-5, XpThreshold ascending; a tier's reward is none, a shared decor piece, a species-specific Grove lore entry, or (tier 5) an idle-animation flag derived from the tier itself. Gifts: every beast rolls from its species' gift table, or \"default\" when it has none of its own; GiftHoursByTier narrows the wait as affinity grows; PityAt guarantees a non-common item within that many common rolls. \"look\" reward kinds are mechanically wired up (GroveRules, the validator) but not authored here yet, to avoid touching the Avatar screen's live cosmetic content out of this PR's no-screens scope; a later PR adds the actual cosmetic content. Validated by BeastCraft.Grove.GroveLibraryValidator (content load and the EditMode tests).",
